  "content": "<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article><article>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">法语版本：</span></strong></h3>\n<p>这款材质包将所有船只转变为真正的赛艇，并为矿车赋予超运动风格，让旅途更加动感十足！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>英语版本：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>这款材质包将所有船只转变为真正的赛艇，并为矿车赋予超运动风格，让旅途更加动感十足！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1234998/description_9eac459c-a748-463c-bd97-80e5907098de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>运行要求：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>这是一个CEM资源包，因此需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>或Optifine才能正常运行。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">来源：</span></strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/car-boat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CAR BOAT</a></p>\n</article>",
